@startuml
title OmniDesk AI Project Context

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Primary User" as User
actor "Project Owner and Developer" as Owner
rectangle "Gmail Provider" as Gmail
rectangle "Telegram Provider" as Telegram
rectangle "AI Service" as AI
rectangle "OmniDesk AI" as System

User --> System : workspace actions
Owner --> System : development and operations
System <--> Gmail : account and communication data
System <--> Telegram : account and communication data
System --> AI : approved request context
AI --> System : summary or editable suggestion
@enduml